{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A music production software based on the <strong>Tone-Tempo-Text</strong> system invented by the author.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It offers powerful expressiveness, equivalent to that of standard staff notation, yet is built entirely on ASCII characters\u2014making it highly efficient for computational processing while remaining easily readable for humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a fast and efficient creative tool, it simplifies melody editing and experimentation, significantly outperforming existing notation systems such as staff notation and piano roll in terms of efficiency.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3987660?t=1757385997","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3987660?t=1757385997","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987660/8de7bfbda9e5cd76213ae9de348c04fbdc01f34e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757385997","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987660/8de7bfbda9e5cd76213ae9de348c04fbdc01f34e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757385997","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A music production software based on the <strong>Tone-Tempo-Text</strong> system invented by the author.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It offers powerful expressiveness, equivalent to that of standard staff notation, yet is built entirely on ASCII characters\u2014making it highly efficient for computational processing while remaining easily readable for humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a fast and efficient creative tool, it simplifies melody editing and experimentation, significantly outperforming existing notation systems such as staff notation and piano roll in terms of efficiency.</p>","developers":["Zeng Wei"],"genres":[{"description":"Audio Production","id":"52"},{"description":"Design